<h2>The bottom line</h2>
<p>Don't believe everything you see on the internet. The drill with 186 million views is not the drill that wins your next game. The drill that wins your next game is the one that puts your players under pressure, in a 1v1 or small group, with a defender they can't ignore.</p>
<p><strong>Train for the game, not the algorithm. Your players will see the difference on Saturday.</strong></p>
